msgid "GEGL Graph"
msgstr "GEGL-graf"

#: src/filters/generic/gegl-graph.xml:29(para)
msgid ""
"This filter is found in the main menu under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filters</guimenu><guisubmenu>Generic</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>GEGL"
" Graph…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar filtret i huvudmenyn under "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Filter</guimenu><guisubmenu>Generiska</guisubmenu><guimenuitem>GEGL-"
"graf…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/filters/generic/gegl-graph.xml:42(title)
msgid "<quote>GEGL Graph</quote> options"
msgstr "Alternativ för <quote>GEGL-graf</quote>"

#: src/filters/generic/gegl-graph.xml:64(term)
msgid "pipeline"
msgstr "Processkedja"

#: src/filters/generic/gegl-graph.xml:66(para)
msgid ""
"Here you can add one or more <ulink url=\"https://gegl.org/operations\">GEGL"
" operations</ulink> that will be performed on the active layer."
msgstr ""
"Här kan du lägga till en eller flera <ulink "
"url=\"https://gegl.org/operations\">GEGL-operationer</ulink> som ska köras "
"på det aktiva lagret."

